Do you enjoy finding patterns in life? Do you want to challenge your observational skills? Come here! Let your observation and logical thinking abilities be verified and tested once!
1. Help your little sister cool down! Make the most of the tools you can use and complete them as much as possible;
2. Do you dislike renters? Disgusting, then come and negotiate. Bring out the evidence and make the renter speechless
3. Observe more, be patient, and try to connect with different scenarios as much as possible to make them reasonable and reasonable;
4. I hope you can have fun here and add color to your life
